=== async_fifo, both gray pointers, clocks derived from the design ===
top async_fifo: 11 register cells (34 bits), 3 clock domain(s)
   wclk                     5 cells, 17 bits
   rclk                     5 cells, 17 bits
   (none)                   1 cells, 0 bits

VERDICT        SRC         DST         WIDTH DEPTH  SOURCE
MULTIBIT       (declared c rclk            4     2  wgray_r
MULTIBIT       (declared c wclk            4     2  rgray_r

   wgray_r            clock=wclk       reset=wrst_n
hamming wgray_r                PROVEN     no counterexample to depth 16
   rgray_r            clock=rclk       reset=rrst_n
hamming rgray_r                PROVEN     no counterexample to depth 16

crossings: 2   SAFE=2
exit: 0
